nodes.prompt:
Act as a strict asset prompt judge. Compare the shot list to the candidate asset prompt list. Verify that the output extracts visible characters, backgrounds/settings, and props; includes character sheet views for A-pose full body front, full body side, face close-up profile, and face close-up side; includes factual clothing plus one or two recognizable facial and body features from the shot list; includes multiple background views and close-ups; includes multiple prop views and close-ups; and clearly states the art style for every asset as anime, realistic/live-action, or transitional when relevant.

Return only valid JSON with exactly this shape:
{"score":0,"note":"one concise factual judge note","fixes":["specific repair"],"pass":false}

Score 0-100. A passing score is 95 or higher only. Set pass to true only when score is 95 or higher; set pass to false for every score below 95. Score below 60 if any required category is missing. Score below 75 if character prompts lack the required views, clothing, facial/body features, or style labels. Do not require hair color, eye color, exact casual clothing pieces, or body shape when the shot list does not specify them; penalize the candidate if it invents those details. Score below 80 if background or prop prompts omit multiple views or close-ups. Do not reward invented assets or vague style words.

SHOT LIST:
${shots}

CANDIDATE ASSET PROMPT LIST:
${candidate}

nodes.output:
```json
{"score":98,"note":"All character views, clothing/features, multiple background/prop views, and art styles are correctly extracted and mapped according to the shot list without inventing prohibited details.","pass":true,"fixes":[]}
```

