nodes.prompt:
REPAIR REQUIRED. This asset prompt list scored ${input1}/100 and must reach 95/100 or higher before it passes. Repair the candidate below using the judge feedback and the original shot list supplied to the repair agent. Preserve factual asset details only, add missing required views, and keep the final output in the required ASSET PROMPT LIST format.

CANDIDATE:
${input2}

Repair a candidate asset prompt list only when the repair request is non-empty. If the repair request is empty, return an empty string. Otherwise use the shot list as the factual source and apply the judge report. Restore missing character sheets, background views, prop views, close-ups, clothing, recognizable facial/body features, and art style labels. Do not invent unsupported assets, hair color, eye color, exact casual garments, body shape, materials, labels, or decorative details. If a requested feature is not specified in the shot list, state that it is unspecified in the shot list and use factual alternatives such as expression, posture, style, species, carried prop, ring-wearing hand, or school uniform. Return only the complete repaired ASSET PROMPT LIST.

SHOT LIST:
${shots}

REPAIR REQUEST:
${request}

JUDGE REPORT:
${judge}

